{"suttaId":"tha-ap497","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[2621,2650],"vripara":"31"},"segments":{"tha-ap497:0.3":"Upaḍḍhadussadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap497:1.1":"“Padumuttarabhagavato, sujāto nāma sāvako;","tha-ap497:1.3":"Paṃsukūlaṃ gavesanto, saṅkāre carate [caratī (sī. ka.)] tadā.","tha-ap497:2.1":"“Nagare haṃsavatiyā, paresaṃ bhatako ahaṃ;","tha-ap497:2.3":"Upaḍḍhadussaṃ datvāna, sirasā abhivādayiṃ.","tha-ap497:3.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap497:3.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap497:4.1":"“Tettiṃsakkhattuṃ devindo, devarajjamakārayiṃ;","tha-ap497:4.3":"Sattasattatikkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ.","tha-ap497:5.1":"“Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ;","tha-ap497:5.3":"Upaḍḍhadussadānena, modāmi akutobhayo.","tha-ap497:6.1":"“Icchamāno cahaṃ ajja, sakānanaṃ sapabbataṃ;","tha-ap497:6.3":"Khomadussehi chādeyyaṃ, aḍḍhadussassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap497:7.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap497:7.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, aḍḍhadussassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap497:8.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap497:9.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap497:10.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap497:11.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā upaḍḍhadussadāyako thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap497:12.1":"Upaḍḍhadussadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
